      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s general statement (“an abnormal chemical process in the body that contributes to disease”) is not explicitly supported in the packet. The packet discusses specific biochemical mechanisms (e.g., accelerated synthesis of lipofuscin bisretinoids in Stargardt disease) but does not provide a general definition of “biochemical defect.”",
